title WF02 Expert validation of a research gap (b) - activity
|Expert|
|LumiGap platform|
start
:Gap is UNDER_VALIDATION\nand listed in expert queue;
repeat
  |Expert|
  :Pick a gap from the queue\n(no conflict of interest);
  :Record one action:\nVALIDATE, CHALLENGE,\nREQUEST_EVIDENCE,\nSUGGEST_EVIDENCE,\nREFINE_SCOPE or REJECT;
  |LumiGap platform|
  if (REFINE_SCOPE?) then ([yes])
    :REFINED;
  elseif (REJECT quorum?) then ([yes])
    :REJECTED;
  elseif (VALIDATE quorum,\nno blocking vote?) then ([yes])
    :VALIDATED;
  else ([no])
    :No change;
  endif
repeat while (Still\nUNDER_VALIDATION?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
stop
note right
  The gap owner (researcher) reads
  the decisions and refines the gap.
end note
@enduml
